<title>USA: Mobile Gas Service increases qtly div.</title>
<headline>Mobile Gas Service increases qtly div.</headline>
<dateline>MOBILE, Ala. 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mobile Gas Service Corp said Wednesday it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.30 per share from $0.28.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable July 1 to shareholders of record on June 20.</p>
<p>Mobile Gas distributes natural gas to utility and nonregulated customers.</p>
</text>
